# The effect power-up's view (spec M5): pause.scenario's way into the race, Up held 200 ms
# before the first power-ups appear (so the effect power-up lies after the first U-turn), the
# car then driven over it (--drive) and the view wavering while its count runs down. A shot
# every 500 ms, then every 100 ms; run with --no-ai --drive.
